	(footprint "ShtukaDruka:Jack_6.35mm_Cliff_S1_Horizontal"
		(locked yes)
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "333b467e-c571-42d8-a74f-976dae18d846")
		(at 67 42.75)
		(descr "6.35 mm (1/4 in) stereo jack, switched, Cliff S1/BBB (CL1115, Digikey 4654-CL1115-ND), horizontal, nose towards -y. Pads from the Cliff drawing CL1115 (issue 1, 25/04/17): 6 holes d1.60, 6.35 pitch along the plug axis, 11.40 across; pins 4/5/6 are the spring contacts the plug makes (sleeve, ring, tip), 1/2/3 the break contacts (sleeve, ring, tip normals). Pad names follow the KiCad AudioJack3_Switch symbol: S/R/T = pins 4/5/6, SN/RN/TN = pins 1/2/3. Body 15.9 wide, 12.70 high, axis 6.50 above the board, overall 33.60 long: thread 9.35 (7/16 in UNF, nut 5.0 + fibre washer 1.6) in front of the mounting face, first pad row 4.25 behind it. Wall 3 mm + washer 1.6 + nut 5.0 = 9.6 > 9.35: leave the washer out or thin the wall at the jack.")
		(tags "jack 6.35mm cliff S1 CL1115 stereo switched horizontal")
